OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face delays after crash
OL,4,Acloses M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters are facing delays after a
OL,7,Fcrash closed a section of the M6 in
OL,8,Fboth directions.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the motorway has
OL,11,Fbeen shut been junction 23 in
OL,12,FNewton-le-Willows, Merseyside, and
OL,13,Fjunction 24 in Ashton-in-Makerfield,
OL,14,FGreater Manchester.
OL,16,FThe agency said the crash at 22:30 BST
OL,17,Fon Sunday resulted in a vehicle fire
OL,18,Fwith Merseyside Fire and Rescue and
OL,19,FNorth West Motorway Police at the
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
