OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face delays after crash
OL,4,Acloses M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M6 is expected to be closed for
OL,7,Fseveral more hours on Monday morning.
OL,8,FDiversions have been put in place with
OL,9,Ftraffic at a standstill on the
OL,10,Fmotorway.
